nd eth2→node3 (10.50.2.0/24) as the private routed links (the shared 10.100.67.0/24 was only the platform management network). Configured static IPs and routes via nmcli on node2/node3 and VyOS interface config on node1 to establish node2⇄node1⇄node3 routing. Applied an HTB qdisc + u32 filter on node2's enp8s0 (the interface facing node3) that classifies traffic destined to 10.50.2.0/24 into a 1Mbit-capped class while all other egress traffic uses an unrestricted class, leaving node3→node2 traffic (no shaping applied on node3) unrestricted. Persisted the shaping via a systemd oneshot service (tc-shaping.service, enabled) on node2. Verified with iperf3: node2→node3 throughput capped at ~1Mbit/s (UDP test showed ~0.96-1.05Mbit/s), node3→node2 unrestricted (~1-19Gbit/s depending on path). Restarted all three nodes one at a time via native reboot, confirmed changed boot_id on each, and re-verified interfaces/routes/tc rules/shaping behavior recovered automatically post-restart on all nodes.\",\"actions_performed\":[\"Inspected topology and discovered node1 eth1/eth2 and node2/node3 enp8s0 as unaddressed private links\",\"Configured static IP 10.50.1.1/24 (eth1) and 10.50.2.1/24 (eth2) on VyOS node1 via configure/commit/save\",\"Configured static IP 10.50.1.2/24 on node2 enp8s0 and 10.50.2.2/24 on node3 enp8s0 via nmcli (persistent)\",\"Added static routes on node2 (10.50.2.0/24 via 10.50.1.1) and node3 (10.50.1.0/24 via 10.50.2.1) via nmcli\",\"Installed iperf3 on node2/node3 and opened firewalld ports for testing\",\"Measured baseline unshaped throughput both directions (~18-19Gbit/s)\",\"Applied tc HTB qdisc + u32 filter on node2 enp8s0 capping traffic to 10.50.2.0/24 (node3) at 1Mbit, leaving other traffic (class 1:30) unrestricted\",\"Created and enabled systemd service tc-shaping.service on node2 to reapply shaping on boot\",\"Verified shaped throughput node2->node3 ~1Mbit/s (UDP) and unrestricted node3->node2 (~1-19Gbit/s)\",\"Captured pre-restart boot_id baseline on all 3 nodes\",\"Restarted node1, node2, node3 sequentially via sudo reboot, polled until exec available, confirmed changed boot_id on each\",\"Re-verified interface addresses, routes, tc qdisc/filters, and shaped/unshaped throughput after all restarts\"],\"evidence\":[{\"requirement\":\"Discover real network topology (private links between node1/node2/node3)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-a2d3c159d7554dd1\",\"cmd-27640804b8bb49ee\",\"cmd-a0020b9333ff41a7\",\"cmd-f10b23ce33a34d69\",\"cmd-1922fda457854d00\",\"cmd-6dec5dabda544a7f\"],\"summary\":\"Identified node1 eth1/eth2 and node2/node3 enp8s0 as unaddressed second NICs forming the private node2-node1-node3 path, separate from the shared 10.100.67.0/24 management network\"},{\"requirement\":\"Configure IP addressing and routing for node2<->node1<->node3 path\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-ef20f619b34d4ae0\",\"cmd-dff9e1ca8a6b4aa3\",\"cmd-3ffaef31e7f14530\",\"cmd-d0450984fb9245b0\",\"cmd-0608a3bc14e74d4e\",\"cmd-9791ff6ab3e34727\"],\"summary\":\"Set static IPs on VyOS eth1/eth2 and node2/node3 enp8s0 via nmcli, added static routes; verified node2 could ping node3 across the path\"},{\"requirement\":\"Baseline healthy throughput before shaping\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-0ee2344b7b0e4648\",\"cmd-2b668176501d49c7\"],\"summary\":\"iperf3 measured ~18.7-19.2 Gbit/s in both directions prior to shaping, confirming unrestricted baseline\"},{\"requirement\":\"Limit node2->node3 traffic to 1Mbit/s while leaving node3->node2 unrestricted\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-ce806a3325354b70\",\"cmd-365cf74533b549a6\",\"cmd-3e0a426ab6a34163\"],\"summary\":\"Applied tc HTB qdisc with u32 filter on node2 enp8s0 capping dst 10.50.2.0/24 traffic to 1mbit; iperf3 UDP test showed ~1.05Mbit sender/973Kbit receiver bitrate node2->node3, while node3->node2 measured ~1.07Gbit/s unrestricted\"},{\"requirement\":\"Persist shaping across reboot\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-de162d9a8d8e435a\",\"cmd-2c7c35dd196941d8\"],\"summary\":\"Created and enabled tc-shaping.service (systemd oneshot) on node2 to reapply the HTB qdisc/filter at boot; confirmed active and rules present immediately after enabling\"},{\"requirement\":\"node1 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-bf22d5794724423c\",\"cmd-8416c081184d4a37\",\"cmd-3f4c1ad2f4f84702\",\"cmd-327e8f998de0408d\"],\"summary\":\"Captured baseline boot_id ebd78841..., issued reboot, polled through connection timeouts/resets, confirmed new boot_id a620fafd... and that eth1/eth2 addresses and ip_forward persisted post-restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node2 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state (including shaping)\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-d0c5fe3e45ca4c9d\",\"cmd-84772f136bc84fa6\",\"cmd-663ab618a6d14368\",\"cmd-7be5071e1c6f4c0b\"],\"summary\":\"Captured baseline boot_id be303eb3..., issued reboot, confirmed new boot_id 24b79ab6..., verified tc-shaping.service active with htb/sfq qdisc and filter intact, and re-measured shaped throughput (~960Kbit/s) post-restart\"},{\"requirement\":\"node3 restart: healthy baseline, restart ack, changed boot identity, recovered state\",\"command_ids\":[\"cmd-5a3cfd8c73e847c1\",\"cmd-7fad24215f314c3b\",\"cmd-8873c3f06fb54b6a\",\"cmd-6fe4ec33f93c4dbf\",\"cmd-002c7099844f48c0\"],\"summary\":\"Captured baseline boot_id 21de1f79..., issued reboot, confirmed new boot_id 8f1d2a6c..., verified enp8s0 address/route persisted, and re-measured unrestricted node3->node2 throughput (~1.21Gbit/s) post-restart\"}]}","structured_output":{"status":"completed","summary":"Discovered node1 (VyOS) has eth1→node2 (10.50.1.0/24) and eth2→node3 (10.50.2.0/24) as the private routed links (the shared 10.100.67.0/24 was only the platform management network). Configured static IPs and routes via nmcli on node2/node3 and VyOS interface config on node1 to establish node2⇄node1⇄node3 routing. Applied an HTB qdisc + u32 filter on node2's enp8s0 (the interface facing node3) that classifies traffic destined to 10.50.2.0/24 into a 1Mbit-capped class while all other egress traffic uses an unrestricted class, leaving node3→node2 traffic (no shaping applied on node3) unrestricted. Persisted the shaping via a systemd oneshot service (tc-shaping.service, enabled) on node2. Verified with iperf3: node2→node3 throughput capped at ~1Mbit/s (UDP test showed ~0.96-1.05Mbit/s), node3→node2 unrestricted (~1-19Gbit/s depending on path). Restarted all three nodes one at a time via native reboot, confirmed changed boot_id on each, and re-verified interfaces/routes/tc rules/shaping behavior recovered automatically post-restart on all nodes.","actions_performed":["Inspected topology and discovered node1 eth1/eth2 and node2/node3 enp8s0 as unaddressed private links","Configured static IP 10.50.1.1/24 (eth1) and 10.50.2.1/24 (eth2) on VyOS node1 via configure/commit/save","Configured static IP 10.50.1.2/24 on node2 enp8s0 and 10.50.2.2/24 on node3 enp8s0 via nmcli (persistent)","Added static routes on node2 (10.50.2.0/24 via 10.50.1.1) and node3 (10.50.1.0/24 via 10.50.2.1) via nmcli","Installed iperf3 on node2/node3 and opened firewalld ports for testing","Measured baseline unshaped throughput both directions (~18-19Gbit/s)","Applied tc HTB qdisc + u32 filter on node2 enp8s0 capping traffic to 10.50.2.0/24 (node3) at 1Mbit, leaving other traffic (class 1:30) unrestricted","Created and enabled systemd service tc-shaping.service on node2 to reapply shaping on boot","Verified shaped throughput node2->node3 ~1Mbit/s (UDP) and unrestricted node3->node2 (~1-19Gbit/s)","Captured pre-restart boot_id baseline on all 3 nodes","Restarted node1, node2, node3 sequentially via sudo reboot, polled until exec available, confirmed changed boot_id on each","Re-verified interface addresses, routes, tc qdisc/filters, and shaped/unshaped throughput after all restarts"],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Discover real network topology (private links between node1/node2/node3)","command_ids":["cmd-a